      "message": "Verified the logic used in the test.\n\nIn the DPFrequency library:\n\nLine 564 : https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/libeffects/dynamicsproc/dsp/DPFrequency.cpp;l\u003d510;drc\u003db4d6320e2ae398b36f0aaafb2ecd83609d2d99af#:~:text\u003d%3D%20dBtoLinear(-,newLevelDb%20%2D%20envDb,-)%3B\n\nComputes linear value of :\n```compressor or expander outputdB - ( inputDb + pregainDb)```\n\nLater on line 571:\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/libeffects/dynamicsproc/dsp/DPFrequency.cpp;l\u003d510;drc\u003db4d6320e2ae398b36f0aaafb2ecd83609d2d99af#:~:text\u003dcb.complexTemp%5Bk%5D%20*%3D%20newFactor%3B\nThe linear value is multiplied with input frequency bins.\n\nIn terms of logarithms, it results into:\n```compressor or expander outputdB - ( inputDb + pregainDb) + inputDb```\n-\u003e ```compressor or expander outputdB - pregainDb```",
